{"classified_as":[{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033799","label":"oil paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033618","label":"paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/object/8740","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":"687, Catalogue Raisonné","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"catalogue raisonnée number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026061"}],"content":"687","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"8740","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"D. H. Lawrence Pine Tree","type":"Name"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":{"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"Pine Tree with Stars at Brett's, N.M.","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks. (Title used by The Wadsworth.)","title":"The Lawrence Tree","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: backing inscription 1.","title":"D. H. Lawrence Pine Tree","type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}},"type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"The Wadsworth","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"Purchased from the artist by the Wadsworth Atheneum Museum of Art, Hartford, 1981. (Source: The Wadsworth, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"The Ella Gallup Sumner and Mary Catlin Sumner Collection Fund","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"A tall tree, seen from below, protrudes into the center of the composition. Its trunk and twisting branches are dark brown, and its fluffy layers of foliage are black and green. Bits of a starry night sky are visible behind the tree.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"31 x 39 1/8 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Orientation is a subject of debate. June *Creative Art* (1931) reproduced this painting as vertical with the tree trunk emerging from the lower left corner. In a 1931 letter to Henry McBride, O'Keeffe objected: '. . . the bottom of it as it is printed should be the left hand side. That tree should stand on its head.'(Letter 56, *Georgia O'Keeffe: Art and Letters* [1987]). Pictured in 1930 New York (An American Place) Stieglitz photograph as a horizontal (see Appendix III, figure 39) in the orientation O'Keeffe describes and as reproduced here. O'Keeffe wrote: 'I spent several weeks at the Lawrence ranch. . . . There was a long weathered carpenter's bench under the tall tree in front of the little house . . . . I often lay on that bench looking up into the tree –– past the trunk and up into the branches. It was particularly fine at night with the stars above the tree' (*Georgia O'Keeffe* [1976] unpaginated, text accompanying entry 57). Oddly enough, the painting is reproduced in *Georgia O'Keeffe* [1976] as a horizontal with the tree trunk emerging from the lower right corner. Regarding the title, it is reproduced as *Lawrence Pine Tree, with Stars* in *Studio* (June 1931) and reproduced and titled *D. H Lawrence's Tree*, in *Creative Art* (June 1931). (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"D. H. Lawrence Pine Tree, 1929","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 31 x 39 1/8 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. D. H. Lawrence Pine Tree, 1929. Oil on canvas, 31 x 39 1/8 inches. The Wadsworth. The Ella Gallup Sumner and Mary Catlin Sumner Collection Fund. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/870000/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/870000"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}